{"id": 990780, "slug": "monument-valley-3", "name": "Monument Valley 3", "name_original": "Monument Valley 3", "description": "<p>Set sail for adventure in this new installment of the award-winning Monument Valley game series, exploring an expansive and beautiful world of puzzles.</p><p><strong>Begin a thrilling new voyage into an enchanting puzzle world. Guide Noor, a young apprentice, through a world of shifting architecture and rising tides as she seeks to restore the fading light.</strong></p><p><strong>DEFY PERSPECTIVE TO SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p>Twist gravity. Shift perspectives. Reshape ancient structures. Every puzzle is a new challenge in logic, intuition, and imagination.</p><p><strong>CHANGE THE WORLD AS YOU EXPLORE</strong></p><p>From serene temples to crumbling ruins, journey through mesmerising environments bursting with colour, mystery, and meaning.</p><p><strong>SET SAIL THROUGH RISING TIDES</strong></p><p>Navigate across shifting seas. Your boat companion is the key to unlocking long-lost secrets and hidden paths.</p><p><strong>THE COMPLETE EXPERIENCE — WITH MORE TO COME</strong></p><p>Monument Valley 3 includes the full story at launch, with additional puzzles and chapters arriving post-release.</p><p><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p> <br/>• Solve mind-bending puzzles across breathtaking spaces   <br/>• Discover new environments shaped by illusion and perspective   <br/>• Experience a rich, emotional journey through impossible geometry and sacred light   <br/>• Includes all future updates and content at no extra cost.   </p><p>Add to your wishlist to be the first to continue Noor’s journey as new chapters unfold.</p><p> </p><p>ustwo games are proud independent developers, best known for the award-winning Monument Valley series, Land’s End, Assemble with Care, and Alba: A Wildlife Adventure.</p><p> </p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-12-10", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-06-13T22:31:16", "background_image